# ProjectFlow workspace (client/) — build-time environment variables (Vite).
# Copy to `client/.env` for local overrides. All variables are optional because
# `client/vercel.json` rewrites /api, /uploads and /socket.io to the API project
# (same-origin requests — no env vars required).
#
# Only set these if you prefer CROSS-ORIGIN API calls instead of rewrites.

# Full API origin, e.g. https://projectflow-api.vercel.app
# VITE_API_BASE=https://<api-vercel-domain>

# Full Socket.IO origin (used for realtime). When unset, the client connects to
# the same origin it is served from.
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://<api-vercel-domain>